                <div class="labs-content-container">
                    <p class="labs-back-to-link">
                        <a href="/">Data for Exploration</a>
                        <i class="icon icon-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        Make Your Own Dataset with Library APIs
                    </p>

                    <h1 class="labs-content-title">Make Your Own Dataset with Library APIs</h1>
                    <p class="labs-content-description">
                        Can't find a particular dataset you are looking for? The Library provides a
                        number of Application Programming Interfaces (APIs) for users with more
                        advanced technical skills to query, search, and download Library content
                        files and structured data.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="search-results list-view">
                        <li class="item">
                            <figure>
                                <div class="iconic-container">
                                    <a href="https://www.loc.gov/apis/json-and-yaml/">
                                        <img
                                            class="iconic"
                                            src="https://labs.loc.gov/static/labs/data/images/apis/json.png"
                                            alt="A screenshot of a color-coded json file representing a Library item's metadata"
                                        />
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </figure>
                            <div class="description">
                                <div class="item-description">
                                    <span class="item-description-title">
                                        <a href="https://www.loc.gov/apis/json-and-yaml/">
                                            Loc.gov JSON API
                                        </a>
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="item-description-abstract">
                                        The loc.gov API provides structured data about Library of
                                        Congress collections. The API was originally designed to
                                        power the loc.gov website, but in addition to providing HTML
                                        for the website it can provide a wealth of information in
                                        JSON format.
                                    </span>
