                                                <p>
                                                    <a href="https://github.com/mccalluc/alt-aapb">
                                                        Experiments with the AAPB API
                                                    </a>
                                                    <em>(Exploration)</em>
                                                </p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th scope="row">Notes</th>
                                            <td>
                                                Scholars may request access to JSON and text
                                                transcripts for items in the AAPB's Online Reading
                                                Room through the AAPB Transcripts Research Access
                                                service. Credentials are required to access the
                                                transcripts API and can be obtained by contacting
                                                <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="1d7c7c6d7f42737269747b747e7c697472736e5d6a7a7f7533726f7a">[email&#160;protected]</a>. Contact AAPB for more
                                                information about accessing the collection for
                                                digital humanities/research projects.
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
