                                                        href="https://github.com/LibraryOfCongress/data-exploration/blob/master/loc.gov%20IIIF%20API/IIIF.ipynb"
                                                    >
                                                        Change image URLs to rotate and resize
                                                        images on loc.gov
                                                    </a>
                                                    <em>(Jupyter Notebook)</em>
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                    <a
                                                        href="https://blogs.loc.gov/thesignal/2018/05/iiif-at-the-library-of-congress/"
